codex
Completed a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s modular edge-colouring definition and matching construction ([paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2507.04254v2)).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `medium`, \(p=67\), 2,144 edges.
- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact compact-answer density \(2.62\times10^{-15}\).
- Five attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference matching algorithm: 8/8, max 54,433 edge inspections.
- Bare oracle: 0/3 at shipping preset.
- Answer: 33 characters, 8 atoms; intended route: 260 field operations.

Deliverables:

- [gen_2507_04254.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/gen_2507_04254.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2507.04254/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Evidence limitation: the environment configured a two-vendor oracle pool. The placebo arm completed 2 scored attempts before the OpenRouter account limit prevented its third; this is recorded as 1/2 with four service errors, without treating errors as failures.
